            "description": "Activates a serpent blade and gains Movement Speed. She can quickly scale walls should she run into them during this period. September 10 update: Skill 1 - Deadly Fang: base damage 30 (+6 per skill level) (+12% Physical Attack) → 35 (+7 per skill level) (+15% Physical Attack). Serpent Blade Attack Cooldown Reduction: 0.15s → 0.15–0.12s.",
